{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2022-05-26 18:30:00', 'title': "MCDONALD'S ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND", 'text': "CHICAGO , MAY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, MCDONALD'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.38 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON JUNE 20, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 6, 2022. UPCOMING COMMUNICATIONS FOR IMPORTANT NEWS AND INFORMATION REGARDING MCDONALD'S, INCLUDING THE TIMING OF FUTURE INVESTOR CONFERENCES AND EARNINGS CALLS, VISIT THE INVESTOR RELATIONS SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S INTERNET HOME PAGE AT WWW.INVESTOR.MCDONALDS.COM."}{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2022-05-26 10:38:00', 'title': "MCDONALD'S SHAREHOLDERS RE-ELECT ALL 12 DIRECTORS AT ANNUAL MEETING", 'text': "CHICAGO , MAY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCDONALD'S CORPORATION (NYSE: MCD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, BASED ON A PRELIMINARY VOTE COUNT PROVIDED BY ITS PROXY SOLICITOR, SHAREHOLDERS HAVE VOTED TO RE-ELECT ALL 12 OF MCDONALD'S HIGHLY QUALIFIED DIRECTORS TO THE MCDONALD'S BOARD: ENRIQUE HERNANDEZ, JR., LLOYD H. DEAN, ROBERT A."}